# Accepted Trivy findings. Every entry says why; keep this list short.

# AWS-0104 "Security group rule allows unrestricted egress to any IP address":
# the EKS node security group (terraform-aws-modules/eks) allows all egress so
# nodes can pull images and reach AWS APIs through the NAT gateway. Restricting
# it needs VPC endpoints for every AWS service the cluster uses.
AWS-0104
